          'url' => 'https://xn--i1b5bzbybhfo5c8b4bxh.xn--11b7cb3a6a.xn--h2brj9c/sites/default/files/2026-01/List_of_ICPs_%28Immigration_Checkpost%29_20012026.pdf',
        ),
        6 => 
        array (
          'label' => 'ekantipur.com',
          'url' => 'https://ekantipur.com/lumbini-pradesh/2026/01/31/en/jamuna-border-crossing-opens-to-third-country-nationals-after-6-years-57-15.html',
        ),
