            'label' => 'www.indembkathmandu.gov.in',
            'url' => 'https://www.indembkathmandu.gov.in/entry-of-indian-registered-vehicles-in-nepal',
          ),
          1 => 
          array (
            'label' => 'kathmandupost.com',
            'url' => 'https://kathmandupost.com/money/2026/10/05/nepal-india-move-to-digitise-cross-border-vehicle-permits',
          ),
